  "lyrics": [
    "[C7]And [F]have [Bb]the [F]bright [Gm]immensities",
    "[Dm]Received [F]our [Gm7]risen [F]Lord,",
    "[C7]Where [F]light [Bb]years [F]frame [Gm]the [F]Pleiades",
    "[Dm]And [Gm]point [F]Orion's sword?",
    "[Dm]Do [Am]flaming [C]suns [C7]His [F]footsteps [C]trace",
    "[C7]Thro' [F]corridors [Dm]sublime,",
    "[C7]The [F]Lord [Bb]of [F]interstellar [C]space",
    "[Dm]And [Gm]conqueror of [F]time?",
    "",
    "The heav'n that hides Him from our sight",
    "Knows neither near nor far;",
    "A little candle sheds its light",
    "As surely as a star.",
    "And where His loving people meet",
    "To share the gift divine,",
    "There stands He with unhurrying feet;",
    "There heav'nly splendors shine."
